type: software
title: "crest — relief, shadows and palaeoglaciers in the browser"
abstract: "Copernicus GLO-30 DEM viewer and simulator in the browser: hillshade, cast shadows, insolation, palaeo-glaciers (−30 ka → today), ice flow, dam break, 3D. No server, no library."
